00:24.000 --> 00:36.000
Lift is defined relative to the flow; downforce describes a downward vertical force in the vehicle/road frame. Both depend on configuration.

00:36.000 --> 00:48.000
Draw relative wind, then label the perpendicular force direction before deciding whether it is lift or downforce.

